    "result": {
      "ok": true,
      "stdout": "Create a new draft project\r\n\r\nAGENT QUICKSTART (driving this as an agent? start here):\r\n  Browse commands:  lyra-cli <domain> --help\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n  lyra-cli <domain> <[subdomain] ...> <action> [--flags] [--options]\r\n\r\n\r\nOPTIONS:\r\n  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit\r\n          --ref TEXT REQUIRED Draft reference, e.g. local://project_name\r\n          --dir TEXT          Optional parent directory for the new draft project folder.\r\n                              Overrides the default workspace root. PC only.\r\n  -v,     --version           Show version information and exit.\r\n          --jq TEXT           Pretty-print JSON output; with an optional selector like\r\n                              .result.items[0].id, output the selected JSON value instead of\r\n                              the full schema envelope.\r\n\r\nEXAMPLES\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft project create --ref local://example\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft project create --ref local://example --dir ./outer\r\n\r\nLEARN MORE\r\n  Use this command when a draft project does not exist yet.\r\n  Use `--dir` to create the draft under an external parent directory.\r\n",
      "stderr": "",
      "output": "Create a new draft project\r\n\r\nAGENT QUICKSTART (driving this as an agent? start here):\r\n  Browse commands:  lyra-cli <domain> --help\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n  lyra-cli <domain> <[subdomain] ...> <action> [--flags] [--options]\r\n\r\n\r\nOPTIONS:\r\n  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit\r\n          --ref TEXT REQUIRED Draft reference, e.g. local://project_name\r\n          --dir TEXT          Optional parent directory for the new draft project folder.\r\n                              Overrides the default workspace root. PC only.\r\n  -v,     --version           Show version information and exit.\r\n          --jq TEXT           Pretty-print JSON output; with an optional selector like\r\n                              .result.items[0].id, output the selected JSON value instead of\r\n                              the full schema envelope.\r\n\r\nEXAMPLES\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft project create --ref local://example\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft project create --ref local://example --dir ./outer\r\n\r\nLEARN MORE\r\n  Use this command when a draft project does not exist yet.\r\n  Use `--dir` to create the draft under an external parent directory.\r\n",
